Me: "Hey! I've looked at this - it's a simple validation rule, no code needed.

     SOLUTION: Validation Rule on Account

     PLAN:
     - Rule checks for duplicate Account.Name before saving
     - Shows error: 'Account name already exists'
     - Takes 30 seconds to set up

     FORMULA:
     NOT(ISBLANK(Id)) &&
     VLOOKUP($ObjectType.Account.Fields.Name,
             $ObjectType.Account, Name, Id) <> Id

     Should I go ahead? Your call!"

You: "Yes"

Me: "Perfect! Here's your validation rule setup:
     [Provides detailed setup guide with screenshots/steps]"
