     Context: Need to handle 10K orders/day with spikes
     Alternatives Considered:
       A) Synchronous triggers → Rejected (hot-row contention)
       B) Batch processing → Rejected (too much latency)
       C) Platform Events → Selected (buffering + elastic scaling)
     Rationale: Platform Events give us natural backpressure and decoupling

